  "body": "Currently SharedArrayBuffer is limited to an agent cluster, but can be cross-origin (though same-site and same-scheme) within that agent cluster. We should consider restricting it further so it cannot be used cross-site, so that SharedArrayBuffer does not become the new document.domain.\r\n\r\ncc @whatwg/security ",
